{{!
    @template mod_lightboxgallery/recent_activity_block

    New gallery comments, for the Recent activity block. Uses the block's usual head, date,
    name and info classes, so the entries look like other activities'.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * comments - The comments:
      * date - When it was made.
      * author - Who made it.
      * gallery - The gallery's name, already formatted.
      * url - The comment on its gallery page.
      * preview - The start of the comment, as plain text.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "comments": [{
            "date": "1 Oct, 14:00",
            "author": "Sam Student",
            "gallery": "The zoo",
            "url": "https://example.com/mod/lightboxgallery/view.php?id=5#c12",
            "preview": "Great photos from..."
        }]
    }
}}
<ul class="unlist">
    {{#comments}}
        <li>
            <div class="head">
                <div class="date">{{date}}</div>
                <div class="name">{{author}} - {{{gallery}}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="info">"<a href="{{url}}">{{preview}}</a>"</div>
        </li>
    {{/comments}}
</ul>
